      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "markdown": "# Tasks remain tasks\n\nA task is a regular task inside its own graph and when projected into another graph. **Project** describes scope and point of view—not a separate semantic type.\n\nLocal tasks live here. A task that needs its own subtasks, questions, decisions, risks, or durable summary may own a graph and appear here through a portal.",
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "michael-task-collection"
        }
      }
    },
